   <message name="IDS_SETTINGS_PRIVACY_SANDBOX_AD_MEASUREMENT_DIALOG_DESCRIPTION" desc="A description of the Ad measurement API. * ΓÇ£Ad measurementΓÇ¥ is the name of an API in this context. We donΓÇÖt use ΓÇ£APIΓÇ¥ with the user, but they need to know that there is something called ΓÇ£A measurementΓÇ¥ and what it does. * ΓÇ£sites you visitΓÇ¥: call the API to get information. The actor is the site, not Chrome. * ΓÇ£restricts cross-site trackingΓÇ¥: Today, with 3rd-party cookies, ad measurement technologies can inadvertently (and intentionally) share considerable information from one site to another). This feature restricts that sharing in order to improve the userΓÇÖs privacy.">
